sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant GitOps
    participant Detector
    participant API as ResourceBinding API
    participant Queue as Legacy Workqueue
    participant SchedulerA as Scheduler A

    GitOps->>Detector: Apply policy change
    Detector->>API: Write generation N+1 (mixed inputs)
    API->>Queue: AddAfter(key, D)
    Note over Queue: Earliest readyAt = t0 + D

    GitOps->>Detector: Apply workload change at t0 + D - epsilon
    Detector->>API: Write generation N+2
    API->>Queue: AddAfter(key, D)
    Note over Queue: Later readyAt is ignored<br/>deadline remains t0 + D

    opt Immediate Add or requeue
        API-->>Queue: Cluster requeue calls Add(key)
        Queue->>SchedulerA: Key can run before t0 + D
    end

    opt Ownership or suspension changes
        GitOps->>API: schedulerName = B<br/>or SchedulingSuspended = true
        Note over API,Queue: Filter emits delete<br/>but delayed key is not cancelled
    end

    Queue->>SchedulerA: Pop key at the retained deadline
    SchedulerA->>API: Lister Get latest ResourceBinding
    Note over SchedulerA,API: Dequeue path does not recheck<br/>schedulerName or suspension
    SchedulerA->>API: Patch scheduling result and status

    Note over GitOps,SchedulerA: Time coalescing reduces some races,<br/>but creates no cross-object transaction
